{"level":"build6","items":[{"id":"build6-01","say":"If the robot has a square head, it gets no antennas. If it has a pointy head, it gets three antennas. Give it a square head, a blue body and legs.","audio":"ddd05ce8ceb8.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"short"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[3,2,0]},{"part":"head","options":["round","square","pointy"]},{"part":"body","options":["yellow","blue","red"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["jet","wheels","legs"]}]},"expect":{"head":"square","body":"blue","bottom":"legs","antennas":0},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-if"},{"id":"build6-02","say":"The head is neither pointy nor round. Give the robot claws, wheels and four eyes.","audio":"f98619e25bc8.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{},"rows":[{"part":"head","options":["pointy","round","square"]},{"part":"eyes","options":[4,1,2,3]},{"part":"arms","options":["short","long","claws"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["jet","wheels","legs"]}]},"expect":{"head":"square","arms":"claws","bottom":"wheels","eyes":4},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-neither"},{"id":"build6-03","say":"Give the robot four eyes, a red body, three buttons and legs. Wait, no. Not four eyes. Give it two eyes.","audio":"13c15eb96186.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"head":"pointy","arms":"long"},"rows":[{"part":"eyes","options":[2,4,3,1]},{"part":"body","options":["green","red","blue","purple"]},{"part":"buttons","options":[1,2,3]},{"part":"bottom","options":["legs","wheels","jet"]}]},"expect":{"eyes":2,"body":"red","buttons":3,"bottom":"legs"},"s":["build","steps4","end"],"v":"build-change"},{"id":"build6-04","say":"Pick the last nose and the first head. The robot also needs wheels and no antennas.","audio":"8df57a65bacc.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"long"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[2,0,1]},{"part":"head","options":["square","pointy","round"]},{"part":"nose","options":["orange","purple","blue"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["jet","wheels","legs"]}]},"expect":{"antennas":0,"bottom":"wheels","nose":"blue","head":"square"},"s":["build","steps4","ordinal"],"v":"build-place"},{"id":"build6-05","say":"The robot gets four eyes, unless it has short arms. If it has short arms, it gets three eyes instead. Give it a square head, claws and a green body.","audio":"854e74ef3b18.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"bottom":"legs"},"rows":[{"part":"head","options":["square","pointy","round"]},{"part":"eyes","options":[3,4,2]},{"part":"body","options":["red","yellow","green"]},{"part":"arms","options":["claws","long","short"]}]},"expect":{"arms":"claws","head":"square","body":"green","eyes":4},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-unless"},{"id":"build6-06","say":"If the robot has a round head, it gets three buttons. If it has a pointy head, it gets one button. Give it a red nose, wheels and a round head.","audio":"6794533452b4.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"long"},"rows":[{"part":"head","options":["pointy","round","square"]},{"part":"nose","options":["yellow","green","red"]},{"part":"buttons","options":[1,3,4]},{"part":"bottom","options":["wheels","legs","jet"]}]},"expect":{"head":"round","bottom":"wheels","nose":"red","buttons":3},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-if"},{"id":"build6-07","say":"The robot has neither long arms nor short arms. Give it a yellow body, an orange nose and one antenna.","audio":"d687f89e1da8.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"head":"round","bottom":"wheels"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[0,2,1,3]},{"part":"nose","options":["orange","yellow","green"]},{"part":"body","options":["green","yellow","orange"]},{"part":"arms","options":["short","long","claws"]}]},"expect":{"arms":"claws","body":"yellow","nose":"orange","antennas":1},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-neither"},{"id":"build6-08","say":"Build a robot with three antennas, one eye, a purple body and a pointy head. Wait, no. Not a purple body. Give it a blue body.","audio":"832fc7d860c9.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"long","bottom":"legs"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[1,3,0]},{"part":"head","options":["round","square","pointy"]},{"part":"eyes","options":[1,3,4]},{"part":"body","options":["yellow","blue","purple"]}]},"expect":{"antennas":3,"eyes":1,"body":"blue","head":"pointy"},"s":["build","steps4","end"],"v":"build-change"},{"id":"build6-09","say":"Pick the last nose and the first head. The robot also needs one button and a jet.","audio":"aa55924dc09a.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"long"},"rows":[{"part":"head","options":["square","round","pointy"]},{"part":"nose","options":["red","green","purple","blue"]},{"part":"buttons","options":[3,2,1]},{"part":"bottom","options":["legs","wheels","jet"]}]},"expect":{"buttons":1,"bottom":"jet","nose":"blue","head":"square"},"s":["build","steps4","ordinal"],"v":"build-place"},{"id":"build6-10","say":"The robot gets no antennas, unless it has a round head. If it has a round head, it gets two antennas instead. Give it a pointy head, a yellow body and claws.","audio":"7c3439a68413.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"bottom":"wheels"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[2,0,3]},{"part":"head","options":["round","pointy","square"]},{"part":"body","options":["blue","red","yellow"]},{"part":"arms","options":["short","claws","long"]}]},"expect":{"head":"pointy","body":"yellow","arms":"claws","antennas":0},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-unless"},{"id":"build6-11","say":"If the robot has claws, it gets four buttons. If it has long arms, it gets three buttons. Give it a blue nose, claws and a jet.","audio":"5c6e17b18ca4.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"head":"pointy"},"rows":[{"part":"nose","options":["blue","purple","orange"]},{"part":"buttons","options":[1,4,3,2]},{"part":"arms","options":["claws","long","short"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["legs","wheels","jet"]}]},"expect":{"arms":"claws","bottom":"jet","nose":"blue","buttons":4},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-if"},{"id":"build6-12","say":"The robot has neither wheels nor a jet. Give it one antenna, a blue body and a yellow nose.","audio":"00f61930f409.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"head":"round","arms":"short"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[1,3,0]},{"part":"nose","options":["blue","purple","yellow"]},{"part":"body","options":["purple","blue","yellow"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["wheels","legs","jet"]}]},"expect":{"bottom":"legs","antennas":1,"body":"blue","nose":"yellow"},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-neither"},{"id":"build6-13","say":"Give the robot four buttons, three eyes, a blue nose and a pointy head. Wait, no. Not a pointy head. Give it a square head.","audio":"a3062aac6f63.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"short","bottom":"wheels"},"rows":[{"part":"head","options":["square","round","pointy"]},{"part":"eyes","options":[3,4,2,1]},{"part":"nose","options":["orange","blue","yellow","red"]},{"part":"buttons","options":[3,2,1,4]}]},"expect":{"buttons":4,"eyes":3,"nose":"blue","head":"square"},"s":["build","steps4","end"],"v":"build-change"},{"id":"build6-14","say":"Pick the second body and the first nose. The robot also needs a jet and one antenna.","audio":"dd5489c28427.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"head":"round","arms":"long"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[0,3,1]},{"part":"nose","options":["blue","red","yellow"]},{"part":"body","options":["blue","yellow","red"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["legs","wheels","jet"]}]},"expect":{"bottom":"jet","antennas":1,"body":"yellow","nose":"blue"},"s":["build","steps4","ordinal"],"v":"build-place"},{"id":"build6-15","say":"The robot gets four eyes, unless it has a jet. If it has a jet, it gets two eyes instead. Give it a round head, a jet and short arms.","audio":"643738a4a4ea.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{},"rows":[{"part":"head","options":["round","pointy","square"]},{"part":"eyes","options":[3,2,4]},{"part":"arms","options":["long","claws","short"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["wheels","jet","legs"]}]},"expect":{"bottom":"jet","head":"round","arms":"short","eyes":2},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-unless"},{"id":"build6-16","say":"If the robot has a square head, it gets no antennas. If it has a pointy head, it gets one antenna. Give it legs, a green nose and a pointy head.","audio":"409f25bd707e.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"long"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[1,2,3,0]},{"part":"head","options":["pointy","round","square"]},{"part":"nose","options":["red","orange","green"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["legs","jet","wheels"]}]},"expect":{"head":"pointy","nose":"green","bottom":"legs","antennas":1},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-if"},{"id":"build6-17","say":"The robot has neither long arms nor short arms. Give it three buttons, a yellow nose and wheels.","audio":"be82c42de671.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"head":"round"},"rows":[{"part":"nose","options":["orange","blue","purple","yellow"]},{"part":"buttons","options":[2,3,1]},{"part":"arms","options":["short","claws","long"]},{"part":"bottom","options":["wheels","legs","jet"]}]},"expect":{"arms":"claws","buttons":3,"nose":"yellow","bottom":"wheels"},"s":["build","steps4","logic"],"v":"build-neither"},{"id":"build6-18","say":"Build a robot with three eyes, a yellow body, a pointy head and no antennas. Wait, no. Not three eyes. Give it one eye.","audio":"1f5597e8fa3a.mp3","t":"build","scene":{"base":{"arms":"short","bottom":"legs"},"rows":[{"part":"antennas","options":[2,1,0]},{"part":"head","options":["round","square","pointy"]},{"part":"eyes","options":[3,2,4,1]},{"part":"body","options":["orange","blue","yellow","red"]}]},"expect":{"eyes":1,"body":"yellow","head":"pointy","antennas":0},"s":["build","steps4","end"],"v":"build-change"}]}
